		(property "DesignNotes" "Littelfuse451 very-fast fuse,6.3A125VDC; interrupt400A@32VDC or50A@125VDC; nominalR9.6mohm,I2t9.17A2s@8ms (not guaranteed minimum). Body6.10+/-0.20 x2.69+/-0.25mm; stock pads checked. Continuous derating25%:4.725A@25C before temperature derating. V1 input design target <=4A continuous,5A short peaks only; verify ambient<=50C and fuse temperature. 24V5A PSU can current-limit below fuse opening current, so PSU OCP must handle sustained shorts; fuse is not a guaranteed5A disconnect or TVS crowbar fuse. No claim of coordinated complete protection. Startup/inrush waveform and repetitive I2t must be tested."
			(at 69.85 67.31 0)
