		(property "DesignNotes" "Electrolytic output,not ceramic-only. Require470uF+/-20%,>=25V,D10mm,P5mm,100kHzESR initial design window0.05..0.2ohm and ripple>=0.3Arms. Limits are selection targets,not measured shop-part data. ReferenceTI table9-6; validate phase margin/startup/load steps over ESR/temperature. Local SAMWHA470u25V10x12.5 listing does not specify series/ESR/pitch; verify sample before release. ManufacturerUPWreferencepart: D10x16mm,P5mm,lead0.6mm,Zmax68mohm@20C/100kHz,ripple1.05Arms@105C/100kHz. StockD10P5 footprintchecked. Localstorelisting doesnotestablishsameUPWseries; do notsubstitute withoutverifiedESR/ripple/pitch. DatasheetZmaxisnotanESRminimum; verifyloop. V1 choice fixed to UPW1E471MPD. Existing local listing is a sourcing lead only; do not treat unspecified series as this exact MPN. No unverified local substitution authorized by this update."
