				(font
					(size 1.016 1.016)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "DesignNotes" "XLSEMIrev2.0:1GND,2FB,3SW/tab,4VC,5VIN. VC bypass is1uF toVIN,notGND. RecommendedVin8..36V,absmax40V. Target6V5A/no fan; requires copper/passive heatsinking and load test. Current limit7A is typical only; no guaranteed minimum given. StockTO263 pitch1.70mm tabPad3 checked against drawing. Metal tab isSW; cannot share bare grounded heatsink. No programmableUVLO/soft-start; do not parallel converter outputs. MG996R.PDF supplied by user, visually checked pp1-2: supply4.8..7.2V; running0.5..0.9A per servo at6V; stall2.5A per servo at6V. Two servos: running1..1.8A /6..10.8W under PDF conditions; simultaneous stall5A /30W. PDF does not guarantee worst-case startup/transient current or specify safe stall duration. Keep original6V/5A continuous design target; this is not a measured board rating. At85% assumed efficiency,24V input~0.53A at10.8W or1.47A at30W. Validate load steps, startup, heatsinking and final-enclosure temperature; no fan. Do not replace target by2A merely from running current."
			(at 939.8 101.6 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
