		(property "DesignNotes" "Selected V1 Nichicon UPW1H471MHD, radial straight leads. 470uF, nominalD12.5x20mm, pitch5mm, lead0.6mm; stockdrill1.2mm; ripple1.50Arms at105C/100kHz, endurance7000h. Pad1 positive24V_MAIN; pad2 negativeGND. Body diameter can be nominal+0.5mm; allow placement margin and vent clearance. Package assignment is NOT final capacitor power qualification: calculate/measure actual RMS ripple, temperature, inrush and transient energy before layout release; substitute if insufficient. 50V capacitor does not clamp A4988 VMOT. Main-bus electrolytics C101/C105/C120/C121 plus C401/C501/C601/C701 total2280uF nominal,1824uF at-20% tolerance (ignoring small ceramic contribution). Stored energy increase24V->30V is0.369J nominal/0.295J at-20%;24V->35V is0.740J nominal/0.592J at-20%. 35V is an absolute limit, not a design target. This finite energy headroom does not qualify motor braking or hot-plug transients."
			(at 186.69 69.85 0)
