		(property "DesignNotes" "Candidate UPW radial straight leads. 100uF, nominalD8x11.5mm, pitch3.5mm, lead0.6mm; stockdrill0.8mm; ripple0.485Arms at105C/100kHz, endurance3000h. Pad1 positive24V_MAIN; pad2 negativeGND. Body diameter can be nominal+0.5mm; allow placement margin and vent clearance. Package assignment is NOT final capacitor power qualification: calculate/measure actual RMS ripple, temperature, inrush and transient energy before layout release; substitute if insufficient. 50V capacitor does not clamp A4988 VMOT."
