		(property "DesignNotes" "Anode2=+5V_LOGIC; cathode1=VSYS. 40V,1A under datasheet thermal conditions. Pico branch planning limit <=0.5A pending Wi-Fi/peripheral load measurement; verify diode dissipation and startup. External source ORed with on-module USB Schottky. Power path: J101+ -> F101 -> Q151 -> +24V_MAIN -> U101 LM2596 buck -> +5V_LOGIC -> D201 anode2/cathode1 -> A201 VSYS39. Pico internal regulator supplies3V3_OUT36. USB uses Pico onboard D1 to VSYS; external5V and USB may coexist without connecting external power to VBUS40. Higher post-diode source supplies VSYS; no forced external-source priority. USB-only does not supply +5V_LOGIC, +6V_SERVO or +24V_MAIN; A4988 VDD can remain powered from3V3 while VMOT is off."
			(at 351.79 59.69 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
