		(property "DesignNotes" "Two parallel local470u50V. 24V->6V5A Cin ripple~2.17Arms total; require combined>=2.5Arms at operating temperature and roughlyequal current sharing. ReferenceUPW1H471MHD1.5Arms each; local equivalent needs verifiedripple/ESR/5mmpitch. Totalinput inrush includesC101,C105,C120,C121 and fourA4988caps; no inrush limit yet. V1 choice fixed to UPW1H471MHD. Existing local listing is a sourcing lead only; do not treat unspecified series as this exact MPN. No unverified local substitution authorized by this update."
