		(property "DesignNotes" "2-pin 2.54mm vertical tin header, 0.64mm square posts; stock pad1/2, nominal drill 1.00mm. Manufacturer hole 1.02 +/-0.05mm; require finished hole >=0.97mm and <=1.07mm from PCB fabricator. Open=LOW via pulldown; shunt=3V3/HIGH. Compatible 2.54mm shunt procurement TBD. Stock two-pin male header symbol replaces generic jumper; fit removable 2.54mm shunt for CLOSED. Pin1/2 net assignments unchanged."
			(at 777.24 415.29 0)
