		(property "DesignNotes" "TI SN74AHCT125PWR selected from HATECH listing. PW0014A: body4.4x5mm, pitch0.65mm, span6.2..6.6mm, height1.2mm max. Stock TSSOP14: pads1..7 left top-to-bottom and8..14 right bottom-to-top; padsize1.475x0.4mm, centre span5.725mm. TI recommended land1.5x0.45mm/span5.8mm; stock IPC land covers lead range. Same 14-pin mapping as former D version. VCC4.5..5.5V; VIH2V. TI RevR table5.4 input leakage<=1uA atVI5.5V andVCC0..5.5V: USB-only Pico input is allowed. No claim of output Ioff. Buy TI PWR/TSSOP14, not HC125 or SOIC/D. Supplier authenticity/lot to be checked on receipt."
			(at 708.66 166.37 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
