		(property "DesignNotes" "V1 decision: keep this position DNP; do not populate 1.5KE30CA as A4988 protection. Vishay 1.5KE30CA VRWM25.6V, VBR28.5..31.5V, maximum clamp41.4V at36.2A 10/1000us exceeds A4988 35V limit. F1016.3A is not a coordinated crowbar with an unspecified24V5A supply. Main-rail overvoltage/regeneration protection remains OPEN: an active braking clamp and its load rating require PSU fault data and axis energy/duty-cycle bounds. DNP resolution does not close that system requirement."
