		(property "DesignNotes" "Selected board header1x3 pitch2.54mm, square0.64mm, mating length6.1mm, body7.62x2.54mm,3mm tails. Pad1=GND,2=+6V_SERVO,3=SERVO2_SIGNAL. Nominal drill1.00mm, finished holes0.97..1.07mm per Harwin. 3A max/contact, not5A per port; actual allowable current also depends on female plug/wire/temperature. TowerPro reports JR plug and1.4A stall for genuineMG996R, actual unit current and fit must be checked. Unkeyed: mark GND/+6V/S and pin1, avoid reversal, provide cable retention. Do not infer rating of unknown servo cable from header rating. User MG996R.PDF: brown=GND, red=VCC, orange=PWM; specified4.8..7.2V, running0.5..0.9A andstall2.5A per servo at6V. Retain6V rail and exact Harwin M20-9990346 selected3A/contact rating; generic header is not automatically qualified."
