		(property "DesignNotes" "Replaces J102 placeholder. PMOS1Gate,2Drain+tab=V24_FUSED,3Source=+24V_MAIN; body diode conducts inputD to outputS during startup. Infineon55V,VGS+/-20V,Rdsmax20mohm@-10V25C. At5A,P=0.5W cold; use1W thermal design allowance and verifyTj<=125C atambient<=50C. Reverse-polarity from discharged condition only; NOT reverse-current blocking,activeOVP,soft-start,current limit or certified E-stop. Charged output plus reversed input can approach55V rating; no reverse hot-plug. Package2.54pitch; maxlead1.01x0.61mm diagonal1.18mm; stock1.1mmholes enlarged to1.4mm,2.0x2.4mm pads. Keep lead shoulders above PCB. TabliveV24_FUSED,insulate if heatsink used."
