		(property "DesignNotes" "CNC Shield style removable assembly: two 1x8 female sockets, pitch2.54mm, row centres12.70mm, H8.5mm, >=3A/contact. Stock Pololu numbering, pad centres and1.6mm pad diameter retained; finished drill1.02mm (+/-0.05mm) for M20-7820842 geometry. Do not solder module directly to carrier. Generic VN socket substitute requires tail/body/current-rating verification. 3D uses Pololu reference board, generic socket/male headers; Nshop clone and heatsink exact envelope not represented. Rsense, actual RESET/SLEEP circuit and1.5A/phase continuous thermal performance remain unverified; VREF=8*Ilimit*Rsense."
