		(property "DesignNotes" "1x4 vertical male header, pitch2.54mm; body10.16x2.54mm; height8.64mm above PCB; 0.64mm square pins,3mm tails. Stock footprint uses1.0mm drill,1.7mm pads. Harwin specifies3A max/contact; validate complete mated cable assembly for1.5A/phase, contact temperature and wire gauge. Generic Dupont jumper ratings are not established by this header rating. Pin1=2B,2=2A,3=1A,4=1B. CNC Shield V3 order; pin1 at top on PCB. Confirm motor coil pairs and do not hot-plug. Header is unkeyed: mark pin1 and coil names on PCB. Exact local stocking unverified; this does not certify generic local substitutes."
